{"t":"Alicorn Set","s":"alicorn-set-9acff","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/NoAmulet_cb0c43.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Alicorn Set</b> consists of the best equipment for Paladins released in the game on the Summer Update 2022, having a minimum level requirement of 400. It is a subset of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Primal%20Set\">Primal Set</a>.\n</p><p>The attributes of these items were decided with the help of the community through the test server of the Summer Update 2022.\n</p><p>The items can be obtained as a one-time reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/primal-ordeal-quest\">Primal Ordeal Quest</a>, as well as from its bosses and related creatures through the Hazard System.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Set\">Set</span></h2>\n<div class=\"equips_set_basic\">\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:19px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoAmulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoAmulet_cb0c43.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:55px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoWeaponRight\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NoWeaponRight_cbfbe3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:1px;top:91px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Alicorn Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alicorn_Ring_cb673f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:1px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Alicorn%20Headguard\"><img alt=\"Alicorn Headguard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alicorn_Headguard_bef18a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"left:37px;top:37px;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NoArmor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" heig